(2. A manager guarantees a client that the portfolio will beat the benchmark this year. The communication problem is best described how?) Tj
0 -16 Td
(A. I\(C\) Misrepresentation of what can reasonably be promised.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(B. III\(E\) Confidentiality of the benchmark construction.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(C. II\(B\) Market Manipulation of the benchmark index.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(D. IV\(B\) Additional Compensation from the guarantee.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Answer: A) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Explanation: Promising a specific return or outperformance is a misrepresentation of what investment results can be guaranteed.) Tj
0 -16 Td
ET
endstream
endobj
