BT
/F1 11 Tf
48 720 Td
(3. A firm pays a bonus to an analyst solely for issuing a buy rating on an investment-banking client. Independence is threatened because of which fact?) Tj
0 -16 Td
(A. Compensation is tied to a specific recommendation on a banking client.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(B. The analyst used a discounted cash flow model.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(C. The company is in the same industry as another coverage name.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(D. The bonus is paid in cash rather than stock.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Answer: A) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Explanation: Pay linked to a particular rating on a banking client impairs independence and objectivity under Standard I\(B\).) Tj
0 -16 Td
ET
endstream
endobj
